  "halloween.contest.mine.same": "Change your outfit to enter a new look.",
  "halloween.help.button": "Help",
  "halloween.help.title": "How Habboween works",
  "halloween.hub.closest.go": "View task",
  "halloween.hub.closest": "Almost there",
  "halloween.help.start": "Getting started",
  "halloween.help.start.1": "Habboween runs for %days% nights. Everything you do earns Cursed Candy, the event currency.",
  "halloween.help.start.2": "The Home tab shows what needs you right now: cards with an orange border and a red dot have something to claim or do.",
  "halloween.help.start.3": "When the last night ends you get one extra day to spend your candy in the Witch's Market. After that, unspent candy disappears!",
  "halloween.help.nights": "%days% Nights of Fright",
  "halloween.help.nights.1": "A new set of tasks unlocks every night. Complete them to earn ingredients and Fright Points.",
  "halloween.help.nights.2": "Tasks count everything you've done since Habboween began, so you can get ahead before a night unlocks, or catch up on nights you missed.",
  "halloween.help.nights.3": "Fright Points fill the milestone track. Each milestone gives candy and a pack of ingredients, with rare Cursed Eyes in the bigger ones.",
  "halloween.help.cauldron": "Brewing in the Cauldron",
  "halloween.help.cauldron.1": "Put %slots% ingredients in the cauldron and press Brew to turn them into candy.",
  "halloween.help.cauldron.2": "Matching a recipe from the Recipe Book pays far more than a random mix. The rare Cursed Eye makes the most valuable potion.",
  "halloween.help.cauldron.3": "Every brew levels up your cauldron. Level it up to unlock better cauldrons and rewards.",
  "halloween.help.community": "The Hotel Cauldron",
  "halloween.help.community.1": "Every potion brewed by anyone on the hotel fills the Hotel Cauldron.",
  "halloween.help.community.2": "Each tier unlocks a reward for everyone, from candy boosts to a rare in the Witch's Market. Keep brewing!",
  "halloween.help.witching": "Witching Hour",
  "halloween.help.witching.1": "A few times a day the cauldrons boil over for %minutes% minutes and every brew pays double candy.",
  "halloween.help.witching.2": "Keep an eye on the Home tab and the sidebar to see when the next one starts.",
  "halloween.help.tot": "Trick or Treat",
  "halloween.help.tot.1": "Knock on %knocks% friends' doors every day. You can only knock on each friend once a day.",
  "halloween.help.tot.2": "You'll get a treat (ingredients or candy) or a harmless trick. Even a trick comes with a little candy.",
  "halloween.help.tot.3": "Your friends earn Fright Points for answering the door, so knocking helps them too.",
  "halloween.help.contest": "Fright Night Fashion",
  "halloween.help.contest.1": "Enter the costume you're wearing. You can update your look any time and keep your rating.",
  "halloween.help.contest.2": "Vote in up to %votes% anonymous duels a day by picking the spookier costume. Every vote earns candy.",
  "halloween.help.contest.3": "The spookiest looks climb the leaderboard, and the top costumes win prizes.",
  "halloween.help.crawl": "Haunted Room Crawl",
  "halloween.help.crawl.1": "Official Habboween events run in %stamps% haunted rooms. Win a GOTW point at an event to stamp your card.",
  "halloween.help.crawl.2": "Collect stamps to unlock card rewards. A full card wins a furni prize.",
  "halloween.help.market": "Candy & the Witch's Market",
  "halloween.help.market.1": "Spend Cursed Candy on Habboween furni and clothing. Some items have a purchase limit.",
  "halloween.help.market.2": "Short on candy? Swap diamonds for candy with the + button next to your candy.",
